00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.910
Ed. Tomosuke Matsumoto

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.820
This ain't so bad...

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.250
Yeah.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.570
It's relaxing.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.780
Kanji characters are so freakin' cool!

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:12.260
I'm glad you like it.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:14.920
A man don't usually do so much reading...

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:17.050
Maybe not <i>you</i>, Captain.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.870
I can't deal with big words...

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:24.190
But maybe it's good 
that it's putting me to sleep.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.090
Yeah. Let's see...

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.360
"Stretches:"

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:35.280
<b>Stretches
(<i>Juunan</i>)</b>

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:34.420
"Exercises performed to extend the muscles 
and leave the body limber."

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:35.280
Exercises performed to extend
 the muscles and leave the body limber

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.980
"Balance, or equilibrium:"

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:43.080
<b>Balance
(Also <i>kinko</i>)</b>

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:43.080
A kind of training that emphasizes 
perfectly matched weight distribution

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:43.080
"A kind of training that emphasizes 
perfectly matched weight distribution."

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.370
"Handstand:"

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:50.670
<b>Handstand
(<i>Sakadachi</i>)</b>

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:50.670
"To stand on one's hands and hold 
the body in an inverted position."

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.670
To stand on one's hands and hold 
the body in an inverted position

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.490
"Splits:"

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:57.010
<b>Splits
(<i>Kaikyaku</i>)</b>

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.010
"To spread the legs as wide as possible."

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.010
To spread the legs as wide as possible

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.980
"Somersault:"

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:03.520
<b>Somersault
(<i>Zenten</i>)</b>

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:03.520
"A move in which the body rotates forward."

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.520
A move in which the body rotates forward

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.500
"Backflip:"

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:10.270
<b>Backflip
(<i>Bakuten</i>)</b>

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.370
"A motion made from a standing position,"

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:10.270
A move from a standing position,
 in which the body rotates 
while leaping backward

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.270
"in which the body rotates 
while leaping backward."

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.990
It's not working!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.870
Shh!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.010
I guess dictionaries won't cut it, either.

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:29.850
I just wanna practice!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:32.070
I wanna <i>do</i> something!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.770
Me, too.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:37.080
Hang in there... That's what real men do!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.680
And yet...

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.010
What should we do, Misato-kun?

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.100
There's only one thing left to do.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.150
There is?

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.400
Cleaning.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.310
Cleaning?!

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.330
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club Dorm</b>

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.270
This ain't half bad.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:09.780
Yeah. Good for concentration.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.050
Feels good, too.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.850
It's nice to get moving, at least.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.070
Great thinking, Clean-Loving Ace!

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.140
Don't call me that.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.020
I finished the entryway.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.770
I'm moving upstairs.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:30.900
Sure!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.670
You know, I've never been in that room...

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.600
You okay, Shotaro?

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.520
You opened that door?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:16.600
Are you okay?

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.030
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.030
What is this room, Captain?

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:26.640
It's fulla stuff, since this building 
was a storehouse for other clubs.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.910
I mean, we stick our stuff in there, too.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.670
I didn't realize it'd gotten so bad.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:34.850
Now's as good a chance as any.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.490
Let's clean this up, too.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.590
Yah.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.490
Hmm? What's up, Misato?

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.310
Aren't these...

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.800
Feeling restless?

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:05.990
Yeah.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.580
Why not go for a jog?

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:14.250
I don't know. 
I told the boys to relax, so...

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.760
I guess you're restless too, Asa-chan.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.480
Hey, this takes me back!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.720
So this was the design?

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:37.680
They're the first uniforms 
we made in our first year.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.590
Did Kurikoma-senpai design these?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.950
No, she wasn't our manager back then.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.780
The coach designed them, 
and his wife made them.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.330
Yet you've still never met her?

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:55.560
Yeah, that reminds me.
You thought he made her up?

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.790
That's right.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:00.830
We figured he'd have brought her 
to meet us by now otherwise.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.670
She's never come to watch us perform, either.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.170
But then we had a thought.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.510
If, by chance, she isn't made up...

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.820
"Shu-chan! Take me to the Inter-High!"

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:18.610
Indeed. Perhaps the coach promised
 to take his wife to the the Inter-High.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.280
And that's why she hasn't come
 to any of your other performances?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.150
I'm bettin' we'll meet his old lady 
when we hit the Inter-High.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:31.470
Which means we gotta make 
it there, no matter what.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.370
So the coach can live happily ever after.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.620
"Shu-chan!"

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.370
That sounds like a manga...

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:42.350
Yeah, I think you're fantasizing a bit.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:49.140
Hey! These are from 
the first time I saw you in action!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.540
Now those, the manager <i>did</i> design.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.640
The culmination of studying men's rhythmic 
gymnastics from a young age, she said.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.820
And I think she's gotten 
even better this year.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.640
When we first came here...

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:12.160
Yeah. It was such a wreck.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.280
We cleaned it up with the coach, and...

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:18.160
We didn't have any money, 
so we couldn't hire a handyman.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.170
We had to do all the repairs ourselves, too.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.710
The coach bagged it, and we fixed it up...

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.640
A place for us to belong.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.280
When we leave here...

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:34.090
Watari, Shotaro, Misato.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.030
Take care of it for us.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.230
Senpai...

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:47.400
I didn't have nothin' till 
I found rhythmic gymnastics.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:52.300
I liked watchin' yakuza movies 
and V-Cinema and stuff,

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.930
but I didn't have nothin' 
I really wanted to do for myself.

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.660
Everything I did was just frontin'.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.920
<b>Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.920
<b>Soshukan Private High School</b>

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:02.460
When I first got here, I didn't have 
no plans to join any clubs, either.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:03.920
But...

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.330
Wow!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.550
That's so cool!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.870
I thought it was pretty damn cool.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.670
New here, huh?

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.720
Good to have you. Wanna give it a try?

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:21.100
At first, I mostly thought 
it'd be cool to do backflips...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.110
Okay! Now leap backward as hard as you can.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.720
Give it all you've got!

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:28.440
Like, <i>bam!</i> <i>Whoosh!</i>

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.950
One, two...

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.200
When that happened...

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:41.840
It was like the whole world
was turned on its head.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.260
It was the first time I did anythin' 
that wasn't just frontin'.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.170
I wanted it for real.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:51.880
So...

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:57.220
I'm gonna protect Ao High's 
men's rhythmic gymnastics for sure.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.640
And I still wanna soar more!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:03.770
From now on... 
and as much as I can with you guys.

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:13.380
To make that happen,
 we first need to win regionals.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.460
True enough.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:15.820
Okay!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:20.330
Let's wrap up the cleaning 
and take the day off!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.310
Yes, sir!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.310
Yah!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.090
Can I get you seconds, Senpai?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.010
Thanks, man! 'Preciate it.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:32.920
Yah.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.530
Shotaro, snag me some soy sauce.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:36.500
Sure.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:45.440
What's with you, man?

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.670
Sorry...

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.970
Watari, grab another towel.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.010
Oh, yah!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:04.870
Watch a man walk away, 
and you'll see who he really is...

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:06.470
Welp, guess it's time to hit the hay.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.830
Guess so.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:08.530
Yah!

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.520
Yeah.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.900
Upsy-daisy...

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.050
Tsukidate.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:19.740
Onagawa.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.780
Watari.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.540
Shotaro.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.700
Misato.

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.130
We're not stoppin' yet.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:32.900
Let's make it through regionals, 
all the way to the Inter-High!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.630
Listen up!

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.020
Tomorrow, we're soarin' high!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.240
Right!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.240
Yah!

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:52.180
What's wrong?

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:55.730
Nothing.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:59.070
I'm just a little restless.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:05.820
I'd probably be more nervous 
if I were the only first-year.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.930
I'm glad you're here.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.360
In all honesty, I was frustrated at first

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:18.630
that the other newbie on the team
 was an ace in junior high.

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:23.440
But having you here, 
trying to catch up with you...

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.220
I think that's what brought me this far.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.850
Thank you so much.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.210
"This far"?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.730
It's only regionals.

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.980
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.660
Likewise... thank you.

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:45.110
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.500
Goodnight.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:48.670
Goodnight.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.420
Shotaro! Shotaro!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:03.990
Shotaro!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.540
Misato-kun...

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:13.980
What's with you?

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.970
Shotaro?

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.180
You okay? Hey!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.300
Shotaro!

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:25.010
Shotaro!
